Topic: Frame economic assessment questions within source limits. Start: Begin a closed-note review with teach for [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Economics_of_Green_Deal/lessons/O004.md#Immediate and delayed checks|O004]]; request one unused prepared delayed item before recap. Teach sends actual committed evidence IDs and conditions. Recall owns dates and Todoist.
